of the Lower Quadrant Scientific Salvage Team, they are tasked with retrieving the Scientists research data from the seemingly abandoned facility. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What, or whom, will they find?</strong><br><strong>    </strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1423050/extras/3b12f42ba17f70b7c812c952bb5ac5e6.poster.avif?t=1748728648\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1423050/extras/3b12f42ba17f70b7c812c952bb5ac5e6.webm?t=1748728648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><strong>    </strong><br><strong>Find Out.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve puzzles, dodge obstacles, and uncover the mysteries lying deep within the Aacmotzz Research Facility.\u00a0</p>",
